pkg:Evidence_v1_22_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.22.0 (version-drift fix)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: user's direct, correct finding -- STORY-7 and STORY-9 both made real content changes to the interactive page while repeatedly re-committing to the same filename, the exact discipline this package enforced on Cross.D in STORY-5 but failed to keep applying to its own subsequent edits. Bumped all 4 real stage files to v1_4_0, re-establishing Cross.D; fixed a genuinely stale internal version string in the page's own footer. Updated the register's 3 live, re-runnable AcceptanceCriterion references to the new filenames, since these describe reproducible checks and would otherwise reference a file that no longer exists -- left historical Evidence text and references to the unrelated RDODI procedure's own version (still genuinely 1.3.0) untouched, since not every '1.3.0' string in the register means the same thing. Re-verified: all Stage1-3 gates re-run fresh and PASS, real Playwright confirms 0 errors, pipeline order unaffected, full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "3b3bc58bbd50d6903d7165fcf4b459ebcf0082f5aacad56d66e1b01f67554772"^^xsd:string .
